  html: "<h2 class=\"text-[12pt] text-orange-300 mb-8 font-light tracking-wide\">Online Safety Code 2024 (under Online Safety and Media Regulation Act 2022)</h2>\n<table class=\"w-full mb-6 border-collapse border border-red-900/30\"><thead><tr><th class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left text-red-400 border-b border-red-900/50 text-xs font-bold tracking-wider\">Field</th><th class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left text-red-400 border-b border-red-900/50 text-xs font-bold tracking-wider\">Value</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-[#39ff14] text-xs border-b border-red-900/20\"><strong class=\"text-orange-300 font-bold\">Location</strong></td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-[#39ff14] text-xs border-b border-red-900/20\">Ireland</td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-[#39ff14] text-xs border-b border-red-900/20\"><strong class=\"text-orange-300 font-bold\">Jurisdiction</strong></td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-[#39ff14] text-xs border-b border-red-900/20\">National</td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-[#39ff14] text-xs border-b border-red-900/20\"><strong class=\"text-orange-300 font-bold\">Status</strong></td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-[#39ff14] text-xs border-b border-red-900/20\">IMPLEMENTING</td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-[#39ff14] text-xs border-b border-red-900/20\"><strong class=\"text-orange-300 font-bold\">Severity</strong></td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-[#39ff14] text-xs border-b border-red-900/20\">4/5 — HIGH</td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-[#39ff14] text-xs border-b border-red-900/20\"><strong class=\"text-orange-300 font-bold\">Categories</strong></td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-[#39ff14] text-xs border-b border-red-900/20\">age_verification, digital_id, biometric_collection</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2 class=\"text-[12pt] text-orange-300 mb-8 font-light tracking-wide\">Description</h2>\n<p class=\"mb-6 text-[#39ff14] leading-relaxed max-w-3xl\">Mandatory age verification for video-sharing platforms headquartered in Ireland (Facebook, Instagram, TikTok, YouTube, X, etc.). Requires &#39;effective age assurance&#39; for adult content - self-declaration not sufficient. Part A active from November 2024, Part B (age verification) from July 2025.</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-[12pt] text-orange-300 mb-8 font-light tracking-wide\">Severity Rationale</h2>\n<blockquote class=\"border-l-2 border-orange-500/50 pl-4 mb-6 text-orange-400/70 italic\"><p class=\"mb-6 text-[#39ff14] leading-relaxed max-w-3xl\">Universal application for designated platform users [+1], criminal penalties for platforms (fines up to EUR 20M or 10% revenue) [+1], biometric/ID document collection for age verification [+1], digital exclusion (requires ID documents/smartphone) [+1], no judicial oversight (platforms decide verification methods) [+1], mission creep from pornography to &#39;harmful content&#39; [+0.5]. Total exceeds 5 - 4/5</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 class=\"text-[12pt] text-orange-300 mb-8 font-light tracking-wide\">Implementation Notes</h2>\n<p class=\"mb-6 text-[#39ff14] leading-relaxed max-w-3xl\">Major civil liberties concerns: (1) Mandatory age verification requires government ID or biometric facial recognition - creates surveillance infrastructure; (2) Platforms designated: Facebook, Instagram, YouTube, TikTok, LinkedIn, X, Pinterest, Tumblr, Reddit (Reddit de-designated May 2025); (3) &#39;Adult-only content&#39; definition vague - platforms decide what requires verification; (4) Children&#39;s data collected for age verification cannot be used for commercial purposes BUT retention periods unclear; (5) No clear standards for age assurance - platforms can choose credit cards, AI facial analysis, behavioral profiling; (6) 9-month implementation delay (July 2025) left children unprotected per Children&#39;s Rights Alliance. Opposition: Tumblr and Reddit took unsuccessful High Court actions. Privacy campaigners concerned about sensitive data storage. Digital Rights Ireland monitoring implementation. Workers&#39; concern: Platform workers (content moderators) face increased exposure to traumatic content; age verification creates barriers to anonymous worker organizing online.</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-[12pt] text-orange-300 mb-8 font-light tracking-wide\">Sources</h2>\n<ul class=\"mb-6 space-y-2 list-none pl-0\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-[#39ff14]\"><span class=\"text-red-400 mt-1 shrink-0\">&#9658;</span><span><strong class=\"text-orange-300 font-bold\">[PRIMARY]</strong> <a href=\"https://www.cnam.ie/coimisiun-na-mean-adopts-final-online-safety-code/\" class=\"text-orange-400 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-orange-200\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Coimisiun na Mean official adoption of Online Safety Code</a></span></li>\n<li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-[#39ff14]\"><span class=\"text-red-400 mt-1 shrink-0\">&#9658;</span><span><strong class=\"text-orange-300 font-bold\">[NEWS]</strong> <a href=\"https://www.rte.ie/news/2025/0721/1524435-online-platform-verification/\" class=\"text-orange-400 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-orange-200\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">RTE News - Age verification rules implementation July 2025</a></span></li>\n<li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-[#39ff14]\"><span class=\"text-red-400 mt-1 shrink-0\">&#9658;</span><span><strong class=\"text-orange-300 font-bold\">[CIVIL_SOCIETY]</strong> <a href=\"https://childrensrights.ie/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Online-Safety-Monitor-2025.pdf\" class=\"text-orange-400 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-orange-200\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Children&#39;s Rights Alliance analysis of Online Safety Code gaps</a></span></li>\n<li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-[#39ff14]\"><span class=\"text-red-400 mt-1 shrink-0\">&#9658;</span><span><strong class=\"text-orange-300 font-bold\">[CIVIL_SOCIETY]</strong> <a href=\"https://5rightsfoundation.com/resource/irish-online-safety-code/\" class=\"text-orange-400 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-orange-200\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">5Rights Foundation analysis of age verification requirements</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<hr class=\"border-red-900/40 my-6\" />\n<blockquote class=\"border-l-2 border-orange-500/50 pl-4 mb-6 text-orange-400/70 italic\"><p class=\"mb-6 text-[#39ff14] leading-relaxed max-w-3xl\"><strong class=\"text-orange-300 font-bold\">Source:</strong> @grey-c0 / Navigators Guild<br>Retrieved via <a href=\"https://github.com/grey-c0/legislation\" class=\"text-orange-400 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-orange-200\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">grey-c0/legislation</a><br>Integrated into scale_9.4 CAS pipeline — do not edit stubs manually.</p>\n</blockquote>\n",
